---
import {withBase} from '../utils/paths';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy & website status" description="Information about the preview website’s forms, third-party links and pending privacy notice.">
 <section class="section privacy-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Care extends to your information</p><h1>Privacy, with<br/><em>transparency.</em></h1><p class="lead">A clear view of this website’s current preview and the decisions required before launch.</p></section>
 <div class="section legal-layout"><nav class="legal-nav" aria-label="Privacy contents"><p class="eyebrow">On this page</p><a href="#preview">01 / Current preview</a><a href="#external-services">02 / External services</a><a href="#before-launch">03 / Before collecting information</a><a class="text-link" href={withBase("/contact/")}>Contact Esperanza <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></nav><div class="legal-content"><p class="pending-note">A client-approved privacy notice is required before this website collects personal information. This page describes the current preview; it is not a reviewed legal policy.</p><section id="preview"><p class="eyebrow">01 / Current preview</p><h2>Your information,<br/><em>in this preview.</em></h2><p>With the default configuration, forms do not transmit or save information. This website does not install analytics, marketing cookies, embedded booking widgets, or tracking pixels. Server hosting logs may still be collected by the selected hosting provider.</p></section><section id="external-services"><p class="eyebrow">02 / Contact and external services</p><h2>When you<br/><em>follow a link.</em></h2><p>Email and phone links open your chosen application. If configured, booking and community links open third-party services with their own privacy practices. No third-party content loads until you follow a link.</p></section><section id="before-launch"><p class="eyebrow">03 / Before collecting information</p><h2>Decisions<br/><em>before launch.</em></h2><p>The business must approve its operating jurisdiction, data controller details, form processor, purpose and legal basis, recipients, access controls, retention period, user rights, and contact process. Sensitive health information should not be requested in the inquiry form.</p></section></div></div>
</Layout>
